<resources xmlns:tools="http://schemas.android.com/tools" tools:ignore="MissingTranslation">
    <string name="agent_touch_dynamic">Adapt to the moment (scenes)</string>
    <string name="agent_touch_dynamic_description">On top of the zones above, the keyboard follows how you type right now within a few dozen taps (lying down, on the move) and forgets it after a five-minute pause or in another app. Deviations that last are kept as scenes: time of day, speed, precision, corrections and shift, never text or location. The calibrated zones change only when the same deviation returns on several days and at different times of day, and then only a little. Nothing in password fields, incognito, fields without learning, with learning paused or on a locked device.</string>
